phosh-session-services 0.2.1
----------------------------
Released October 2026
* Stop os-update when the system doesn't support sysupdates
* Don't pull phosh-syncbus into the session. Phosh will DBus activate
  it when needed
* Various bug and robustness fixes
* Issues fixed:
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phosh-session-services/-/work_items/5
* Contributors:
    * Arun Mani J
    * Guido Günther

phosh-session-services 0.2.0
----------------------------
Released July 2026
* Add new OS update check service
* Ensure services get pulled into the session
* Issues fixed:
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/syncbus/-/work_items/1
* Contributors:
    * Arun Mani J
    * Guido Günther
* UI translations:
    * Guido Günther (de)

